# NovaMart Inventory & Order Management Portal

A SAPUI5 freestyle application for browsing the NovaMart product catalog,
managing stock levels, and raising reorder requests. Built as a training
capstone project — no backend; all data lives in a local JSON model.

## How to Run (SAP Business Application Studio)

1. Open the `inventory-portal` folder as a Dev Space in BAS (Full Stack Cloud
   Application dev space, or SAPUI5 dev space).
2. Open a terminal in the project root and install dependencies:
```bash
   npm install
```
3. Start the app:
```bash
   npm start
```
   This runs `ui5 serve --open index.html` and opens a live preview.
4. To test the German locale, append `?sap-language=DE` to the preview URL.
5. To lint the codebase:
```bash
   npm run lint
```

